# Author identity mapping.
#
# This repository's work is owned by a single GitHub account: FisiFla
# <flavio@fisicaro.xyz>. Commits were authored under several other addresses
# depending on which machine or tool produced them, which made GitHub split
# the contribution graph across a second account ("Fisicaro") and several
# unclaimed identities.
#
# The format below is "Proper Name <proper@email> <commit@email>": any commit
# authored with the right-hand address is attributed to the left-hand identity.
